    {
      "bbox": [
        184,
        478,
        978,
        523
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, there is a strike of the employees of the\nDepartment of Sanitation of the City of New York; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 18,
          "mean": -0.2592,
          "min": -1.2086
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 25,
          "mean": -0.0281,
          "min": -0.701
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 40,
        "area_px": 36754,
        "density": 0.00109,
        "chars": 104,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 2600.0
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        185,
        543,
        1082,
        610
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, such strike has resulted in unusual accumulations\nof garbage, refuse and rubbish in and on buildings, land, sidewalks\nand streets throughout the City of New York; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2174,
          "min": -1.1485
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0019,
          "min": -0.0638
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15,
        "area_px": 59772,
        "density": 0.00025,
        "chars": 175,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 11666.67
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        187,
        630,
        1044,
        718
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, as a result of this strike accumulations of\ngarbage, refuse and rubbish have reached such a level and degree\nthat there is an alarming danger to the health and welfare of the\npeople of the City of New York; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1972,
          "min": -1.03
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0008,
          "min": -0.0314
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15,
        "area_px": 76807,
        "density": 0.0002,
        "chars": 219,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14600.0
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        189,
        739,
        1032,
        847
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Board of Health of the City of New York\ntoday has issued a resolution declaring the existence of a state\nof emergency and advising me to take all necessary measures to\nassure the maintenance of the public health and safety and the\nprevention of disease during this emergency; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2097,
          "min": -1.1089
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 61,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0095
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 24,
        "area_px": 93390,
        "density": 0.00026,
        "chars": 292,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12166.67
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        191,
        867,
        1041,
        911
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Mayor's Emergency Control Board today has\ndeclared and transmitted to me a declaration of health emergency;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1865,
          "min": -1.0529
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 24,
          "mean": -0.0028,
          "min": -0.0491
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 21,
        "area_px": 38520,
        "density": 0.00055,
        "chars": 120,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 5714.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        194,
        930,
        1017,
        975
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, by the power vested in me as Mayor of\nthe City of New York, I hereby order as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2114,
          "min": -1.1372
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
